OL,3,GNEWSABereaved families accuse Plaid
OL,4,Aministers of betrayal over Covid review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner for families bereaved
OL,7,Fduring the pandemic says she feels
OL,8,Fbetrayed by the announcement of a
OL,9,FWales-only Covid review by Plaid Cymru
OL,10,Fministers, instead of the public
OL,11,Finquiry the party had supported for
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,FOn Tuesday ministers told the Senedd
OL,15,Fhow the review would be led by Prof
OL,16,FDaniel Wincott of Cardiff University,
OL,17,Fand would conclude by March 2029.
OL,19,FThe entire opposition united against
OL,20,Fthe plans, accusing ministers of
OL,21,Fletting victims down.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
